 "clips": [
  {
   "id": "hook-0",
   "shot": "hook",
   "speaker": "N",
   "text": "You just got pulled over. Red and blue in the mirror.",
   "file": "vo/hook-0.wav",
   "start": 0.12,
   "dur": 2.712
  },
  {
   "id": "hook-1",
   "shot": "hook",
   "speaker": "N",
   "text": "And before either of you says a word... you've already judged each other.",
   "file": "vo/hook-1.wav",
   "start": 3.112,
   "dur": 3.53
  },
  {
   "id": "title-0",
   "shot": "title",
   "speaker": "N",
   "text": "Because a traffic stop is two scared people. One window between you.",
   "file": "vo/title-0.wav",
   "start": 7.242,
   "dur": 3.834
  },
  {
   "id": "p1-0",
   "shot": "p1",
   "speaker": "N",
   "text": "Problem one. He's scared too.",
   "file": "vo/p1-0.wav",
   "start": 11.376,
   "dur": 1.657
  },
  {
   "id": "hispov-0",
   "shot": "hispov",
   "speaker": "N",
   "text": "From his seat, he's reading your car. Paper tags. Loud music. Tank top.",
   "file": "vo/hispov-0.wav",
   "start": 13.333,
   "dur": 4.407
  },
  {
   "id": "hispov-1",
   "shot": "hispov",
   "speaker": "N",
   "text": "Every movie he's seen fills in the rest.",
   "file": "vo/hispov-1.wav",
   "start": 18.02,
   "dur": 2.02
  },
  {
   "id": "danger-0",
   "shot": "danger",
   "speaker": "N",
   "text": "His training says any stop could turn deadly.",
   "file": "vo/danger-0.wav",
   "start": 20.34,
   "dur": 2.274
  },
  {
   "id": "danger-1",
   "shot": "danger",
   "speaker": "N",
   "text": "One big Florida study put it at about one in six and a half million stops.",
   "file": "vo/danger-1.wav",
   "start": 22.894,
   "dur": 4.648
  },
  {
   "id": "danger-2",
   "shot": "danger",
   "speaker": "N",
   "text": "But fear doesn't read data.",
   "file": "vo/danger-2.wav",
   "start": 27.822,
   "dur": 1.399
  },
  {
   "id": "p2-0",
   "shot": "p2",
   "speaker": "N",
   "text": "Problem two. You're labeling him back. Power trip. Quota. The badge.",
   "file": "vo/p2-0.wav",
   "start": 29.521,
   "dur": 3.705
  },
  {
   "id": "bias-0",
   "shot": "bias",
   "speaker": "N",
   "text": "Here's what you don't know. In a famous study, split-second threat decisions followed cultural stereotypes.",
   "file": "vo/bias-0.wav",
   "start": 33.526,
   "dur": 6.058
  },
  {
   "id": "bias-1",
   "shot": "bias",
   "speaker": "N",
   "text": "Even in people with no personal prejudice.",
   "file": "vo/bias-1.wav",
   "start": 39.865,
   "dur": 2.61
  },
  {
   "id": "slice-0",
   "shot": "slice",
   "speaker": "N",
   "text": "A face gets judged in a tenth of a second. What he sees lands before what you say.",
   "file": "vo/slice-0.wav",
   "start": 42.774,
   "dur": 4.775
  },
  {
   "id": "rule-0",
   "shot": "rule",
   "speaker": "N",
   "text": "Rule one. Disarm the fear before you speak.",
   "file": "vo/rule-0.wav",
   "start": 48.149,
   "dur": 2.522
  },
  {
   "id": "disarm-0",
   "shot": "disarm",
   "speaker": "N",
   "text": "Hazards on. Dome light on. Window down. Hands on the wheel.",
   "file": "vo/disarm-0.wav",
   "start": 50.971,
   "dur": 3.461
  },
  {
   "id": "disarm-1",
   "shot": "disarm",
   "speaker": "N",
   "text": "Driver handbooks say it plainly. Let him see you.",
   "file": "vo/disarm-1.wav",
   "start": 54.713,
   "dur": 2.638
  },
  {
   "id": "approach-0",
   "shot": "approach",
   "speaker": "N",
   "text": "Footsteps. Flashlight. He sees your hands, and his shoulders drop.",
   "file": "vo/approach-0.wav",
   "start": 57.65,
   "dur": 3.683
  },
  {
   "id": "ask-0",
   "shot": "ask",
   "speaker": "O",
   "text": "Do you know why I stopped you?",
   "file": "vo/ask-0.wav",
   "start": 61.634,
   "dur": 1.645,
